{
  "slug": "workflow-toolkit",
  "name": "Workflow Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Get up to speed in any codebase, any size. Non-opinionated workflow plugin with session journaling, local task tracking, GitHub issue sync, knowledge base generation, and lifecycle hooks. All backed by SQLite, all local.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **21 skills**, **2 agents** and **7 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (21): `contribution-check` (Pre-flight checklist for open source contributions), `create-agent` (Creates a new Claude Code custom subagent configuration), `create-skill` (Creates a new Claude Code custom skill (slash command)), `db-viewer` (Open the journal SQLite database in a GUI viewer (DB Browser for SQLite, or similar)), `distill-concept` (Distills a codebase concept into a structured knowledge base entry), `help` (Show usage information for any workflow-toolkit skill), `issues-list` (List and filter tracked GitHub issues from the local SQLite database), `issues-sync` (Sync GitHub issues from the repo into the local SQLite database for tracking), and 13 more\n- **Agents** (2): `contribution-guard` (Read-only code reviewer that checks changes against project coding rules and contribution guidelines), `github-issues` (Manages GitHub issue tracking — syncing issues from GitHub, querying the local database, triaging, and providing analysis)\n- **Hooks** (7): `SessionStart`, `Stop`, `PreCompact`, `PostToolUse`, `SubagentStop`, `TaskCompleted`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install workflow-toolkit@claude-community` from `dougwithseismic/workflow-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 21,
    "agent": 2,
    "hook": 7
  },
